    <!-- UNCERTAIN_HMN：意译浓缩，需母语者复核 -->
    <string name="thanks_mp_desc">Lub app no tau txais kev tshoov siab los ntawm MP-Manager: ob sab saib ib sab thiab ua hauj lwm hla sab (luam, txav, lo rau lwm sab); cov kab ntaub ntawv — duab me me, npe thiab \'hnub + qhov loj\'; lub ⋮ zaub mov thiab \'Lwm Yam Ua\' cuaj daim; thoob khib nyiab nrog rov qab thiab rho tawm mus ib txhis; lub qhov rais tsim; tus kho ntawv nrog lej kab; thoob khib nyiab, cov cim thiab cov nplaub ntawv tso rau saum; Shizuku/root; nyem thiab rho tawm, zais thiab qhib zais; thiab cov chaw cia tshwj xeeb. Ua tsaug rau MP-Manager uas qhib raws li GPL-3.0 rau hauv GitHub (https://github.com/AbdurazaaqMohammed/MP-Manager), thiab ua tsaug rau nws tus sau AbdurazaaqMohammed.</string>
    <!-- UNCERTAIN_HMN：意译浓缩，需母语者复核 -->
